    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.snippets\n\n### Description\n\nWhen a new stable release is made can an automated changelog or releases page be created for all plugins such as https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.snippets? If you're using only one plugin you can check that github page to see upgrade changes.",
